@startuml branch-model
!include _theme.iuml

rectangle "Private repository" as Repo {
  rectangle "main\nfree edition" as Main
  rectangle "pro\nmain plus the pro/ folder" as Pro
}

rectangle "Tag vX.Y.Z" as FreeTag
rectangle "Tag pro-vX.Y.Z" as ProTag
rectangle "rup-flow-free-X.Y.Z.zip" as FreeZip
rectangle "rup-flow-pro-X.Y.Z.zip" as ProZip
rectangle "Documentation site\npublic repository" as Docs

Main --> Pro : merge main into pro
Main --> FreeTag
Pro --> ProTag
FreeTag --> FreeZip : release workflow
ProTag --> ProZip : release workflow
FreeZip --> Docs : described, never published as source
ProZip --> Docs : described at feature level
@enduml
